.SH HISTORY
μEmacs descends from MicroEMACS (1985) through Petri Kutvonen's uEmacs/PK to Linus Torvalds' personal fork.
This build preserves that lineage while modernizing for 2026 with C23, terminal fidelity, and UTF-8.
